{"id":"vod_md_73681","vodId":"73681","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"非人学生与厌世教师","name_cn":"非人学生与厌世教师","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20260112-1/36d3e2067bb4a2ce5669bc81f96b448c.jpg"},"summary":"她们不是人类。但是，比任何人都憧憬着人类对人间关系有心理阴影的奔三NEET：人间零。这样的我，刚想着要转职山清水秀的山区学校，过着优哉游哉的复健教师生活——那儿居然是为了让人外成为人类而设立的女校？！人鱼族水月镜花、狼人尾尾守一咲、兔子右左美彗、鸟羽根田帷……与这样不可思议的学生们渡过的日子。为什么想要成为人类，成为人类了想要干什么——我通过她们学习着“人类”。这既不是异世界奇幻，也不是转生人生重来。只不过是一所奇怪的学校，与向着成为人类努力的人外女子们一起渡过的，一位教师的故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-04-05 19:54:10","episodeCount":13,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260112/BSiFMV8a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260118/imqhCzyJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260125/hEs1BIwg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260201/wVNcJ8wT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260208/CSYQ4437/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260215/5AkmRefk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260223/zLsq9BNm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260301/JDuUsaij/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260308/ak5qpSX1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260315/mb2Tbars/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260322/lbQClmyV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260329/AHOhMS82/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20260405/uONun0tS/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:16.148Z"}